      <activity id="75ab2403-57b4-591b-9999-4f40e0492b41" activityNameId="6821546f-9e51-5324-92b4-02a037d5e813" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, tram</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, tram
For energy data, yearly energy consumption figures from selected service garages of Swiss transport companies is employed. The data is presented for a life span of a tram of 30 years.;
UUID: fc296a01-4a07-3529-be9b-1f441cb549eb
The inventory includes materials  energy and resource consumption of garages. Rail and road transport of materials is accounted for
Location: Data represent Swiss conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data, is based on a brief survey of public transport companies.  
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fc296a01-4a07-3529-be9b-1f441cb549eb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
